# App Review demo account for scripts/review_account.sh (skill heji-review-account). Sourced as bash.
# The password is never here: it lives in ~/Credentials/review-accounts.env and App Store Connect.

REVIEW_EMAIL="appreview+contempo@hejitech.com"
# The Worker that serves POST /api/review-sign-in, and where it runs. It doesn't deploy on push:
# `npm run deploy -w @contempo/web` after changing it.
WORKER_DIR="projects/contempo/services/web"
WRANGLER_ENV="production"
SITE="https://contempo.hejitech.workers.dev"
BUNDLE_ID="com.hejitech.contempoapp"

# App Store Connect › App Review Information › Notes.
REVIEW_NOTES="Sign in: on the sign-in screen tap \"Sign in with email\" (below Sign in with Google) and use the demo account above. People sign in with Google; email sign-in is only for accounts we hand out, such as this one. Every sign-in with it starts from demo data: two rental properties (Lakeview Cabin, Downtown Loft) and five work entries from the last few days.

What to try: log new work by voice, text or the + button (the on-device model turns what you say into an entry; nothing is sent to a server for AI), confirm an entry, and open the hours summary. The Apple Watch app logs work by voice and shows today's hours."
